scenarios.text:
Coding Assistant — Understands the enterprise codebase and automates the development of software through natural language commands. Uses MCP to access data sources. This scenario will include:
a. Connecting to the source code repository to enable the editing of files;
b. Interacting with a code repository to create and commit pull requests (PRs), resolve merge conflicts, and similar actions;
c. Developing, executing, and fixing unit and integration tests;
d. Browsing proprietary and web resources;
e. Assisting in the deployment of software.
